1
00:00:11,982 --> 00:00:14,280
Useless and in vain.

2
00:00:14,520 --> 00:00:19,780
Everything yields to the wolf's song.

3
00:00:21,612 --> 00:00:23,852
The wolf pines without a family.

4
00:00:24,120 --> 00:00:27,196
Days are dusty with grey powder.

5
00:00:31,282 --> 00:00:33,564
I forgot what I was seeking.

6
00:00:33,614 --> 00:00:36,764
The wolf will show its snarl.

7
00:00:40,772 --> 00:00:43,174
Away from home, closer to the bottom.

8
00:00:43,214 --> 00:00:46,368
The wolf will howl at the moon.

9
00:00:49,718 --> 00:00:51,400
Racing along the rails.

10
00:00:51,400 --> 00:00:53,820
Sleepers, sleepers, russet leaves.

11
00:00:53,820 --> 00:00:57,092
Melting snow.

12
00:00:59,310 --> 00:01:01,185
Tumbling along mountain streams.

13
00:01:01,240 --> 00:01:03,460
Sharp rocks, mossy thickets.

14
00:01:03,460 --> 00:01:06,574
Wolf pits, I'll run away.

15
00:01:07,146 --> 00:01:09,026
I'll run away.

16
00:01:19,216 --> 00:01:21,405
Hands to the nose, a firmer stance.

17
00:01:21,714 --> 00:01:26,168
I laugh and smell of bile.

18
00:01:28,776 --> 00:01:31,080
All the illnesses of my mind

19
00:01:31,360 --> 00:01:36,130
Bloom in the wolf's song.

20
00:01:38,388 --> 00:01:40,620
The wolf will look from under its brow.

21
00:01:40,940 --> 00:01:46,264
The wolf has grown accustomed; he smells of pain.

22
00:01:48,098 --> 00:01:50,100
Hesitantly, in secret,

23
00:01:50,432 --> 00:01:53,476
The wolf will wag its tail.

24
00:01:56,816 --> 00:01:58,580
Racing along the rails.

25
00:01:58,580 --> 00:02:01,020
Sleepers, sleepers, russet leaves.

26
00:02:01,020 --> 00:02:04,252
Melting snow.

27
00:02:06,488 --> 00:02:08,405
Tumbling along mountain streams.

28
00:02:08,460 --> 00:02:10,660
Sharp rocks, mossy thickets.

29
00:02:10,660 --> 00:02:13,826
Wolf pits, I'll run away.

30
00:02:14,332 --> 00:02:16,878
I'll run away.

31
00:02:25,688 --> 00:02:29,365
And what if I were to reveal my own secret to you?

32
00:02:29,560 --> 00:02:31,400
That I'm a wolf, and there are no more like me.

33
00:02:31,400 --> 00:02:34,020
That I'm warm, I bite, and I'm very much alive.

34
00:02:34,340 --> 00:02:35,820
And no song lives in me,

35
00:02:35,820 --> 00:02:36,740
But a plaintive howl.

36
00:02:36,740 --> 00:02:38,765
And if you were to suddenly believe me,

37
00:02:39,100 --> 00:02:39,860
That you're no wolf,

38
00:02:39,860 --> 00:02:41,085
No enemy, and no friend,

39
00:02:41,120 --> 00:02:43,880
But the main cog of my life's clock,

40
00:02:43,880 --> 00:02:45,400
The one that turns all the hands

41
00:02:45,400 --> 00:02:47,345
And breathes from all corners.

42
00:02:54,402 --> 00:02:56,240
Racing along the rails.

43
00:02:56,450 --> 00:02:58,700
Sleepers, sleepers, russet leaves.

44
00:02:58,966 --> 00:03:01,006
Melting snow.

45
00:03:04,090 --> 00:03:05,845
Tumbling along mountain streams.

46
00:03:06,146 --> 00:03:08,260
Sharp rocks, mossy thickets.

47
00:03:08,500 --> 00:03:10,472
Wolf pits, I'll run away.

48
00:03:10,722 --> 00:03:11,514
I'll run away.

49
00:03:12,140 --> 00:03:12,872
I'll run away.

50
00:03:13,098 --> 00:03:14,392
I'll run away.

51
00:03:23,216 --> 00:03:24,980
Racing along the rails.

52
00:03:24,980 --> 00:03:27,460
Sleepers, sleepers, russet leaves.

53
00:03:27,460 --> 00:03:32,780
Just don't you fall behind, fall behind.

54
00:03:32,780 --> 00:03:34,765
Tumbling along mountain streams.

55
00:03:34,860 --> 00:03:37,060
Sharp rocks, mossy thickets.

56
00:03:37,060 --> 00:03:43,324
Sing along with the wolf's song, sing along.

57
00:03:51,966 --> 00:03:55,786
In the heart of the icy taiga,

58
00:03:57,484 --> 00:04:05,602
Just run, just run.

59
00:04:07,006 --> 00:04:15,594
Racing, racing.
